Executive Summary
Triage AI Revision 4 represents an enterprise-grade, hardware-diagnostic and forensic retrieval framework engineered for component-level electronics repair, motherboard failure triage, and micro-soldering workflow guidance. This specification provides the complete technical architecture for Triage AI Rev 4, optimized specifically for deployment on Vercel serverless and edge infrastructure.
By leveraging Next.js App Router, Vercel AI SDK, Vercel Edge Network, Vercel Blob, Upstash Redis (Vercel KV), and Vercel Postgres (pgvector), Triage AI Rev 4 achieves sub-100 millisecond initial triage responses, real-time hardware telemetry streaming over WebUSB, interactive vector schematic rendering, and zero-hallucination factual grounding via a 4-stage Chain-of-Verification (CoVe) pipeline.
