When generating Level 2 and Level 3 repair instructions, Triage AI Rev 4 provides precise thermal reflow specifications for SAC305 (Sn96.5 / Ag3.0 / Cu0.5) lead-free alloy to prevent PCB delamination, component pop-corning, or solder bridging:
